{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01PNcpQTCY6zsWopU95AjQ5n","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All acceptance criteria verified:\n\n| AC | Result |\n|----|--------|\n| AC1 | `go build ./cmd/ts/` compiles with no errors |\n| AC2 | `echo 'hello world' | go run ./cmd/ts` produces `Feb 25 12:46:13 hello world` (matches `<Mon> <DD> <HH:MM:SS> hello world` pattern) |\n| AC3 | `printf 'a\\nb\\nc\\n' | go run ./cmd/ts -s` produces three lines with `00:00:00` elapsed timestamps in HH:MM:SS format |\n| AC4 | `go run ./cmd/ts -z` prints usage to stderr and exits 1 |\n| AC5 | Empty stdin produces no output and exits 0 |\n| AC6 | `go run ./cmd/ts -i -s` prints mutual-exclusivity error to stderr and exits 1 |\n| AC7 | `printf 'no timestamp here\\n' | go run ./cmd/ts -r` passes through unchanged |\n| AC8 | `golangci-lint run ./cmd/ts/...` reports 0 issues |\n\n**Implementation summary** (`cmd/ts/main.go`):\n- **Flag parsing**: Custom parser supporting `-i`, `-s`, `-m`, `-r` with mutual exclusivity validation (prd004-ts R3.4, R6.5, R7.2)\n- **Default mode**: Reads stdin line by line, prepends `%b %d %H:%M:%S` timestamp, flushes after each line (R1)\n- **Custom format**: Strftime-to-Go layout conversion with ts-specific subsecond extensions `%.S`, `%.s`, `%.T` using sentinel placeholders (R2)\n- **Elapsed modes**: `-s` (elapsed since start) and `-i` (incremental per line) using `time.Duration` delta formatted in GMT timezone (R3, R4)\n- **Monotonic mode**: `-m` uses Go's monotonic clock reading via `time.Now().Sub()` (R5)\n- **Relative mode**: `-r` scans for syslog, ISO-8601, RFC 2822, and lastlog timestamp patterns, replacing with human-readable relative age strings (R6)\n- **SIGPIPE**: Goroutine catches SIGPIPE and calls `os.Exit(0)` (R1.6)\n- **TZ handling**: Respects TZ env for wall-clock; forces GMT for elapsed modes (R8)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":469,"cache_read_input_tokens":109983,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":469},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1d62ce98-2e02-4a75-b0d3-3740033df4a4","uuid":"ea55652a-fb1d-4629-a661-66ce164399b2"}
